{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787531116961,"sessionID":"ses_fceda74b8ffec0f01p0fDyvTkH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a7b562af6594f1e0","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/cs/y_h_9x9j2hj316xhs3mvszd80000gn/T/coding-assistant-benchmark-kZFwBF/checkout/benchmark/projects/T7-securitized-trade-capture/ARCHITECTURE-SOL.md","offset":30,"limit":120},"output":"<path>/private/var/folders/cs/y_h_9x9j2hj316xhs3mvszd80000gn/T/coding-assistant-benchmark-kZFwBF/checkout/benchmark/projects/T7-securitized-trade-capture/ARCHITECTURE-SOL.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n30: \n31: ## Architecture\n32: \n33: Add a separate route and keep the benchmark dashboard unchanged:\n34: \n35: ```text\n36: app/trade-capture/page.tsx\n37: └── TradeCaptureApp\n38:     ├── DeskInsights\n39:     ├── TradeTicket\n40:     ├── validation summary\n41:     ├── TradeBlotter\n42:     └── TradeReview\n43: ```\n44: \n45: `page.tsx` is a server route shell that imports route-specific CSS and the\n46: client application. `TradeCaptureApp` owns a reducer containing trades, the\n47: ticket draft, selected trade ID, filters, search, and sort. There are no server\n48: actions, storage APIs, network calls, or database calls.\n49: \n50: Pure domain code lives under `app/trade-capture/domain/` with no React imports.\n51: Route styles use `tc-` prefixed selectors below `.tc-shell` so they do not\n52: change the existing dashboard in `app/globals.css`.\n53: \n54: ## Stable contracts\n55: \n56: ```ts\n57: export type ProductType =\n58:   | \"agency-rmbs\"\n59:   | \"non-agency-rmbs\"\n60:   | \"cmbs\"\n61:   | \"abs\"\n62:   | \"clo\"\n63:   | \"tba-mbs\";\n64: \n65: export type TradeStatus = \"draft\" | \"validated\" | \"booked\" | \"cancelled\";\n66: export type Side = \"buy\" | \"sell\";\n67: export type TradeModifier =\n68:   | \"regular\"\n69:   | \"specified-pool\"\n70:   | \"stipulation\"\n71:   | \"dollar-roll\"\n72:   | \"weighted-average-price\";\n73: export type ExceptionSeverity = \"error\" | \"warning\";\n74: \n75: export interface AllocationInput {\n76:   id: string;\n77:   label: string;\n78:   currentFace: number | null;\n79: }\n80: \n81: export interface Allocation {\n82:   id: string;\n83:   label: string;\n84:   currentFace: number;\n85: }\n86: \n87: export interface TradeException {\n88:   code: string;\n89:   severity: ExceptionSeverity;\n90:   field: keyof TradeDraft | \"allocations\";\n91:   message: string;\n92: }\n93: \n94: export interface AuditEvent {\n95:   id: string;\n96:   at: string;\n97:   action: \"created\" | \"draft-saved\" | \"validated\" | \"booked\" | \"cancelled\";\n98:   detail: string;\n99: }\n100: \n101: export interface TradeEconomics {\n102:   currentFace: number;\n103:   grossPrincipal: number;\n104:   signedExposure: number;\n105: }\n106: \n107: export interface TradeDraft {\n108:   internalTradeId: string | null;\n109:   clientTradeId: string;\n110:   executionTimestamp: string;\n111:   tradeDate: string;\n112:   settlementDate: string;\n113:   side: Side;\n114:   productType: ProductType;\n115:   securityId: string;\n116:   issuerDeal: string;\n117:   trancheClass: string;\n118:   counterparty: string;\n119:   book: string;\n120:   trader: string;\n121:   currency: \"USD\";\n122:   originalFace: number | null;\n123:   factor: number | null;\n124:   price: number | null;\n125:   coupon: number | null;\n126:   spreadBps: number | null;\n127:   accruedInterest: number | null;\n128:   agency: string;\n129:   poolNumber: string;\n130:   weightedAverageLife: number | null;\n131:   collateralType: string;\n132:   rating: string;\n133:   modifier: TradeModifier;\n134:   allocations: AllocationInput[];\n135:   note: string;\n136: }\n137: \n138: export type Trade = Omit<TradeDraft, \"internalTradeId\" | \"allocations\"> & {\n139:   internalTradeId: string;\n140:   status: TradeStatus;\n141:   allocations: Allocation[];\n142:   economics: TradeEconomics;\n143:   exceptions: TradeException[];\n144:   auditEvents: AuditEvent[];\n145:   synthetic: true;\n146: };\n147: \n148: export interface DeskSummary {\n149:   activeTradeCount: number;\n\n(Showing lines 30-149 of 319. Use offset=150 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"\n## Architecture\n\nAdd a separate route and keep the benchmark dashboard unchanged:\n\n```text\napp/trade-capture/page.tsx\n└── TradeCaptureApp\n    ├── DeskInsights\n    ├── TradeTicket\n    ├── validation summary\n    ├── TradeBlotter\n    └── TradeReview\n```\n\n`page.tsx` is a server route shell that imports route-specific CSS and the\nclient application. `TradeCaptureApp` owns a reducer containing trades, the\nticket draft, selected trade ID, filters, search, and sort. There are no server\nactions, storage APIs, network calls, or database calls.\n","truncated":true,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/private/var/folders/cs/y_h_9x9j2hj316xhs3mvszd80000gn/T/coding-assistant-benchmark-kZFwBF/checkout/benchmark/projects/T7-securitized-trade-capture/ARCHITECTURE-SOL.md","text":"\n## Architecture\n\nAdd a separate route and keep the benchmark dashboard unchanged:\n\n```text\napp/trade-capture/page.tsx\n└── TradeCaptureApp\n    ├── DeskInsights\n    ├── TradeTicket\n    ├── validation summary\n    ├── TradeBlotter\n    └── TradeReview\n```\n\n`page.tsx` is a server route shell that imports route-specific CSS and the\nclient application. `TradeCaptureApp` owns a reducer containing trades, the\nticket draft, selected trade ID, filters, search, and sort. There are no server\nactions, storage APIs, network calls, or database calls.\n\nPure domain code lives under `app/trade-capture/domain/` with no React imports.\nRoute styles use `tc-` prefixed selectors below `.tc-shell` so they do not\nchange the existing dashboard in `app/globals.css`.\n\n## Stable contracts\n\n```ts\nexport type ProductType =\n  | \"agency-rmbs\"\n  | \"non-agency-rmbs\"\n  | \"cmbs\"\n  | \"abs\"\n  | \"clo\"\n  | \"tba-mbs\";\n\nexport type TradeStatus = \"draft\" | \"validated\" | \"booked\" | \"cancelled\";\nexport type Side = \"buy\" | \"sell\";\nexport type TradeModifier =\n  | \"regular\"\n  | \"specified-pool\"\n  | \"stipulation\"\n  | \"dollar-roll\"\n  | \"weighted-average-price\";\nexport type ExceptionSeverity = \"error\" | \"warning\";\n\nexport interface AllocationInput {\n  id: string;\n  label: string;\n  currentFace: number | null;\n}\n\nexport interface Allocation {\n  id: string;\n  label: string;\n  currentFace: number;\n}\n\nexport interface TradeException {\n  code: string;\n  severity: ExceptionSeverity;\n  field: keyof TradeDraft | \"allocations\";\n  message: string;\n}\n\nexport interface AuditEvent {\n  id: string;\n  at: string;\n  action: \"created\" | \"draft-saved\" | \"validated\" | \"booked\" | \"cancelled\";\n  detail: string;\n}\n\nexport interface TradeEconomics {\n  currentFace: number;\n  grossPrincipal: number;\n  signedExposure: number;\n}\n\nexport interface TradeDraft {\n  internalTradeId: string | null;\n  clientTradeId: string;\n  executionTimestamp: string;\n  tradeDate: string;\n  settlementDate: string;\n  side: Side;\n  productType: ProductType;\n  securityId: string;\n  issuerDeal: string;\n  trancheClass: string;\n  counterparty: string;\n  book: string;\n  trader: string;\n  currency: \"USD\";\n  originalFace: number | null;\n  factor: number | null;\n  price: number | null;\n  coupon: number | null;\n  spreadBps: number | null;\n  accruedInterest: number | null;\n  agency: string;\n  poolNumber: string;\n  weightedAverageLife: number | null;\n  collateralType: string;\n  rating: string;\n  modifier: TradeModifier;\n  allocations: AllocationInput[];\n  note: string;\n}\n\nexport type Trade = Omit<TradeDraft, \"internalTradeId\" | \"allocations\"> & {\n  internalTradeId: string;\n  status: TradeStatus;\n  allocations: Allocation[];\n  economics: TradeEconomics;\n  exceptions: TradeException[];\n  auditEvents: AuditEvent[];\n  synthetic: true;\n};\n\nexport interface DeskSummary {\n  activeTradeCount: number;","lineStart":30,"lineEnd":149,"totalLines":319,"truncated":true}},"title":"benchmark/projects/T7-securitized-trade-capture/ARCHITECTURE-SOL.md","time":{"start":1787531116950,"end":1787531116958}},"id":"prt_03128418f001lbK6uwVa1aH0IB","sessionID":"ses_fceda74b8ffec0f01p0fDyvTkH","messageID":"msg_031282617001if7jLG4avDLJZL"}}
